# How The Virtual Circle earns, with no upfront capital

## Membership at a glance
| Level | Price | What it is |
|---|---|---|
| **Tier 1 · Circle Member** | Free forever | Feed, hubs, messages, Circle BFF, free courses, simulators, job applications, Circle Laughs, booking mentors, Circle Rage Room *Simmer* |
| **Glow Keeper** (Keep the Circle Glowing project) | Any contribution from ₱20 | Glow ring, badge, Glow Wall spot, +20 free Circle Rage Room throws a day, for 30 days per contribution |
| **Tier 2 · Circle Pro** | ₱149 / 30 days | All training materials, **earn by teaching** (gigs + modules), shown first to clients, unlimited AI practice |

Founding Ambassadors (up to 50 real VAs who help grow the circle in the first 90 days) get Tier 2 free for 90 days.

**Principle: VAs never pay to belong.** The feed, hubs, messages, Circle BFF, free courses, simulators, job applications and Circle Rage Room are free forever. Money comes from the people who get value from a trusted, verified VA community: clients, and VAs who *choose* an edge. That's what makes members feel they *need* the platform rather than *have to pay* for it.

Running costs are near zero: Cloudflare and Google Drive free tiers. The only small recurring cost is SMS sign-up codes. Every peso earned can go back into the platform.

